# KeyMint's root key from the host (dsa-channeld.rc defines the service). This system script
# runs as init, which may make a folder in /dev; a vendor script's mkdir runs as vendor_init.
# The folder is tmpfs, so the key it holds is gone when the guest stops, and only nobody,
# KeyMint's user and the user the service runs as, may enter it. Its label
# (dsa_keymint_key_file, vendor_file_contexts) lets only KeyMint's domain read what is in it.
on init
    mkdir /dev/dsa_keymint 0700 nobody nobody
    start dsa_keymint_key
